description	"The Jedi Tactician

The Jedi Tactician focuses all of their training into improving the combat abilities of their allies through direct and area healing as well as empowerment. 

Weaponry:
- Lightsaber
-- ^4Blue ^7Style Only
-- Saber / Blaster Defense (1)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump  (2)
- Push  (1)
- Sense (3)
- Absorb (3)
- Heal  (3)
- Team Heal (3)
- Team Energize (3)

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (1)
- CTF: 35s Respawn

^3Abilities:
- Can Heal allies [Hold Use on Allies]

^2Strengths^7: Powerful support abilities.
^1Weaknesses^7: Weakest combat skills of all the Jedi."